media: ipu-bridge: Add upside-down quirk for Dell XPS 14 DA14260

The XPS 14 DA14260 has its OV08X40 front sensor mounted upside down,
but its firmware's SSDB reports a rotation of 0, so the sensor's
camera_sensor_rotation control reads 0 and the picture comes out
upside down for anything that trusts it. Report 180 for its OVTI08F4
sensor, as linux-next's 010009ac5ad3 does for the Dell Pro 14 Premium
PA14260, which has the same sensor.

--- a/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu-bridge.c
+++ b/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu-bridge.c
@@ -136,6 +136,13 @@
 		},
 		.driver_data = "OVTI02C1",
 	},
+	{
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_SYS_VENDOR, "Dell Inc."),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_NAME, "XPS 14 DA14260"),
+		},
+		.driver_data = "OVTI08F4",
+	},
 	{} /* Terminating entry */
 };
 
